sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant E as Editor
    participant F as File system
    U->>E: ctrl+s or ctrl+e
    opt no path yet
        E->>U: prompt "save as", default name
        U->>E: enter a name
        E->>E: append .tuidraw if needed, set path
    end
    alt ctrl+s
        E->>F: write path.tmp
        E->>F: rename over path
        E->>E: clear dirty
    else ctrl+e
        E->>F: write base.txt
        E->>F: write base.ans
    end
    E->>U: status message
